      "id": "holt_order_chronicle",
      "cell": [
        19,
        4
      ],
      "kind": "book",
      "label": "The Order's chronicle",
      "model": "book",
      "codex": "order_chronicle",
      "flag": "argynvost_skull_known",
      "text": "The chronicle of the Order of the Silver Dragon, in many hands. Its founding by the Lord Argynvost, who kept a lamp burning in his tower so that the valley would know it was watched. Tournaments, a flood, a wolf winter. Then the army over the mountains, the passes lost one by one, the house besieged. The last page is in a heavy, careful hand: The house fell tonight. My lord died in the courtyard. They have taken his head to the castle to hang on a wall. The Order will not rest. V.H."
    },
