      "cell": [
        28,
        17
      ],
      "kind": "book",
      "label": "The duty roster",
      "model": "ledger",
      "codex": "vladimir_roster",
      "text": "A duty roster, kept every night in the same square hand for longer than anyone should keep anything. Gate: Teodor, Bastian. Wall: Ilona, Mattias. Beacon: none. Beacon: none. Beacon: none. Every night the same, and under each night one line: All present. None dismissed."
    },
